c.2026-06-29.2026-09-27","LRCX.d.netinc.2025-09-29.2025-12-28","LRCX.d.netinc.2025-12-29.2026-03-29","LRCX.d.netinc.2025-06-30.2026-06-28","LRCX.d.netinc.2025-06-30.2026-03-29","LRCX.d.netinc.2026-06-29.2026-09-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $6.5 billion: operating cash flow of $7.6 billion less capital spending of $1 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["LRCX.d.ocf.2025-06-30.2025-12-28","LRCX.d.ocf.2025-06-30.2025-09-28","LRCX.d.ocf.2025-06-30.2026-03-29","LRCX.d.ocf.2025-06-30.2026-06-28","LRCX.d.ocf.2026-06-29.2026-09-27","LRCX.d.capex.2025-06-30.2025-12-28","LRCX.d.capex.2025-06-30.2025-09-28","LRCX.d.capex.2025-06-30.2026-03-29","LRCX.d.capex.2025-06-30.2026-06-28","LRCX.d.capex.2026-06-29.2026-09-27"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2.4 billion at the end of FY2026, against $2.7 billion a year earlier. That is 10.5% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["LRCX.rpo.2026","LRCX.rpo.2025","LRCX.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $2.3 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $2.6 billion a year earlier.","cites":["LRCX.deferred.2026","LRCX.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 23,300 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $997,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["LRCX.q.employees","LRCX.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $5.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $3.7 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $1.9 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["LRCX.cash.2026","LRCX.debtLong.2026","LRCX.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"LRCX":{}},"quotes":{"LRCX.q.employees":{"c":"LRCX","kind":"employees","n":23300,"quote":"As of August 4, 2026, we had approximately 23,300 regular full-time employees, of which over 26% were engaged in research and development.","source":"LRCX-0000707549-26-000037","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-08-07","proof":"e3bc1f1d309c790ad1127bbfb5685c4ea9c80efcc97456e2693217cc2b581841"}}}